        "type": "generative",
        "visual_code": "<section class=\"bg-[#0F0F10] text-[#F4F4F9] py-24 px-6 font-['Bricolage_Grotesque']\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n    <div class=\"text-center mb-20\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-6xl md:text-7xl font-black mb-6 uppercase tracking-tighter leading-none\">\n        THE ARCHITECTS <br/><span class=\"text-[#E2D1C3] italic\">OF THE NEW ERA</span>\n      </h2>\n      <p class=\"text-[#E2D1C3]/60 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light\">Where Parisian craftsmanship meets the raw energy of the streets.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-stretch\">\n      <!-- LEFT PILLAR -->\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\">\n        <div class=\"bg-[#161617] border border-white/10 p-8 rounded-2xl flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#E2D1C3]/40 transition-colors group\">\n          <p class=\"text-xl font-light italic leading-relaxed mb-12 opacity-90\">\n            \"The craftsmanship rivals the houses in Paris, but the heart is strictly for the streets. This is the inclusion the industry has been avoiding.\"\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <img src=\"testimonial_002_url\" alt=\"Elena Rodriguez\" class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all\">\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-sm\">Elena Rodriguez</p>\n              <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#E2D1C3]/60\">Lead Stylist</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/5 p-8 rounded-2xl text-center\">\n          <p class=\"text-4xl font-black text-[#E2D1C3] mb-1\">15K+</p>\n          <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-50\">Active Members</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- CENTER PILLAR (PRIMARY) -->\n      <div class=\"bg-[#1A1A1B] border-2 border-[#E2D1C3]/20 p-10 lg:p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group shadow-2xl\">\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-10 -right-10 opacity-5 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity\">\n          <svg width=\"200\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M14.017 21L14.017 18C14.017 16.8954 14.9124 16 16.017 16H19.017C19.5693 16 20.017 15.5523 20.017 15V9C20.017 8.44772 19.5693 8 19.017 8H16.017C14.9124 8 14.017 7.10457 14.017 6V5C14.017 3.34315 15.3602 2 17.017 2H19.017C20.6739 2 22.017 3.34315 22.017 5V15C22.017 18.3137 19.3307 21 16.017 21H14.017ZM3 21L3 18C3 16.8954 3.89543 16 5 16H8C8.55228 16 9 15.5523 9 15V9C9 8.44772 8.55228 8 8 8H5C3.89543 8 3 7.10457 3 6V5C3 3.34315 4.34315 2 6 2H8C9.65685 2 11 3.34315 11 5V15C11 18.3137 8.31371 21 5 21H3Z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light leading-snug mb-16 relative z-10\">\n          \"Nectar doesn't just provide clothes; they provide a <span class=\"text-[#E2D1C3] italic\">sense of belonging</span>. It's a revolutionary shift for our community.\"\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-6 relative z-10\">\n          <img src=\"testimonial_001_url\" alt=\"Marcus Thorne\" class=\"w-24 h-24 rounded-full border-2 border-[#E2D1C3] p-1 grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\">\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"font-bold text-2xl uppercase tracking-tighter\">Marcus Thorne</p>\n            <p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-[#E2D1C3]/60\">Director, Metro Youth Alliance</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- RIGHT PILLAR -->\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\">\n        <div class=\"bg-[#161617] border border-white/10 p-8 rounded-2xl flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-[#E2D1C3]/40 transition-colors group\">\n          <p class=\"text-xl font-light italic leading-relaxed mb-12 opacity-90\">\n            \"A brand that understands luxury is about how you feel in your skin. Nectar is dismantling barriers while maintaining an elite aesthetic.\"\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <img src=\"testimonial_004_url\" alt=\"Amara Okafor\" class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all\">\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-sm\">Amara Okafor</p>\n              <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#E2D1C3]/60\">Founder, New Thread</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl text-center\">\n            <p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#E2D1C3]\">98%</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40\">Sentiment</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white/5 border border-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl text-center\">\n            <p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#E2D1C3]\">4.9/5</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40\">Reviews</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
